{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Love Wizdom Academy and want to support its development? The Supporter Pack is just for you! With your contribution, you\u2019re helping shape the future of the game \u2014 and we\u2019ve prepared a few exclusive goodies to show our gratitude.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Official soundtrack \u2013 Let the melodies of the Academy follow you beyond the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Digital art poster featuring the exclusive \u201cSupporter\u201d seal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wallpapers to bring a touch of magic to your desktop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">High-resolution world map of Wizdom Academy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Special role &quot;Enchanted Supporter&quot; on the official game Discord</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And if you visit us at an event, your coffee is on us!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Important information:</strong> <br>This pack does not include any in-game features. It\u2019s a way to show your support for Wizdom Academy and help us continue crafting a world full of wonder. Thank you for being part of the journey!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3679700?t=1745330656","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3679700?t=1745330656","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679700/9ec95894f54f402fc0ea98807d3edf322c041462/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745330656","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679700/9ec95894f54f402fc0ea98807d3edf322c041462/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745330656","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"d